message: "If you use this artifact, please cite the paper and, where you rely on the data directly, the deposit."
title: "Oracles That Cannot Fail: replication artifact"
abstract: >-
  Mutant-level dataset and a self-contained reproduction program for a mutation
  analysis of twelve model-free property-test suites in a deployed air traffic
  control simulator. Six mutated targets, 48 mutation runs. Every published
  figure recomputes from the dataset alone.
